WEBVTT

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:05.980
Persia!

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:08.480
Inuzuka...

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:09.660
Romeo Inuzuka
Black Doggy House - 1st Year Leader

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:12.490
You damn Western nobles...

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:13.900
Juliette Persia
White Cats House - 1st Year Leader

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.640
Barbarians of Touwa...

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.060
Today, the superior clan...

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:21.000
Will be vindicated!

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:38.100
Inuzuka, should I lend a hand?

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:40.410
No.

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:44.350
I'll be the one to defeat Persia. Don't interfere.

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:48.230
It's a showdown between the leaders
of Black Doggies and White Cats!

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:54.070
Take...

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:56.170
this!

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:01.790
Dahlia Academy.

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:05.390
A prestigious boarding school where students of the
Eastern Nation of Touwa

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:08.240
and the Principality of West study side by side.

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:09.310
However,

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:10.220
Black Doggy Dormitory
Black Doggy House

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:13.050
the students from the Touwa student dorm,

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:13.110
the students from the Touwa student dorm,
Black Doggy House,

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:13.360
White Cats Dormitory
White Cats House

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:16.800
and the West's student dorm, White Cats House,
White Cats House
White Cats Dormitory

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:17.730
and the West's student dorm, White Cats House,

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:22.700
are locked in confrontation day in, day out.

00:01:53.540 --> 00:02:00.790
I was watching you with my hidden feelings from afar

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:09.640
As you lit up with a thousand lights, I felt the wind blowing at that moment

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:15.640
I expressed all of my feelings to you

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:20.980
I heard my heart beating, I can't look away

00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:26.150
I decided to become strong enough to change the world

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:29.910
So that I can protect you

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:35.410
Beyond the dazzling times, we will have a miraculous encounter

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:40.960
Which will ensure that we get closer despite our limitless dreams

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:46.010
but know that we will courageously overcome this obstacle that faces us

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:52.970
Don't forget that we are united by a force of determination that no one knows.

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:56.780
Romio Inuzuka and Juliet Persia

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:00.750
Lady Persia, please leave this to me.

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:01.910
Scott?

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:04.280
I will protect you with my life.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:07.040
That's all I could hope to do.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.660
Then die!

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:11.310
If that's all your bespectacled ass can hope to do,

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:13.670
then you should just lock her up in the dorm!

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:15.630
Inuzuka!

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:18.130
I do not require protection.

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:20.130
Lady Persia!

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:21.510
Come at me with all you've got, Inuzuka.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:24.240
Shut it!

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:27.390
I can't go all out against a girl. It'll kill my motivation.

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:29.440
Get out of here!

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:32.700
Romio Inuzuka, all you do...

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:34.700
is make a fool of me.

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:36.520
That's enough.

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:43.110
Isn't that...?

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:43.180
The White Cats' prefect?

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:45.510
Anne Sieber
The Prefect of the White Cats
The White Cats' prefect?

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:46.750
We're in for it.
The Prefect of the White Cats
Anne Sieber

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:52.000
Causing such a ruckus on school grounds
is less than admirable.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:56.780
Shut up! We have no obligation
to abide by the White Cats.

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:58.730
Is that so?

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:05.010
Then I'll have no choice but to contact
the Black Doggy's representative prefect.

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:18.000
That's all for today.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.030
Inuzuka, I swear I'll take you down!

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:25.280
Dumbass! You're not even a blip on our radar!
Right, Inuzuka?

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:28.280
Wait for me, Persia.

00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:39.300
Damn it!

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.050
That was some interruption!

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:45.650
Prefects are the highest authority
when it comes to student supervision.

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:48.810
If they have their eyes on you,
it's not the time to be fighting.

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:50.780
Still, that Persia...

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:53.820
If we defeat her, we can win for sure.

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:56.750
We're counting on you for that, Inuzuka.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.690
What's wrong? Are you tired?

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:06.610
Do you need Hasuki to comfort you?

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:13.120
I didn't mean it in a perverted way. Don't take it like that!

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:15.960
Inuzuka already left, by the way.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:16.750
Seriously?

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:25.590
Damn it!

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:29.400
I don't know what to do.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:32.360
We've been quarreling since elementary school.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:33.820
Stupid Inuzuka!

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:35.980
You're a girl, you think you can win?

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:39.700
There you go again!

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:41.360
You jerk!

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.740
Through middle school,
and now even in high school,

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:46.430
it's like we haven't progressed at all.

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:49.630
That's right. I've always...

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:51.680
Always...

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.680
Loved Persia!

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:58.250
I love her! I love her!

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.380
I don't actually want to fight.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.550
I have to make sure she isn't hurt by the other guys.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.640
That's all I can do.

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:08.730
I will protect you with my life.

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:11.300
That's all I could hope to do.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:11.390
That tool!
That's all I could hope to do.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:12.760
That tool!

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:17.700
He just went and said the words
I've always wanted to say but couldn't!

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:20.700
I'm sick of these games!

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:22.770
How can I get her attention?

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.960
Maybe I'll just confess outright.

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:28.710
If I can make it sound really cool, then maybe...

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:29.840
Could you make bear soup for me every morning?

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:30.840
Cool confession scene
Inuzuka's Imaginary

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:32.720
Inuzuka's Imaginary
Cool confession scene

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:34.160
How manly! Take me!
Inuzuka's Imaginary
Cool confession scene

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:38.160
But if I fail I couldn't show my face on the grounds again!

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:42.540
Should I do some recon?

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.890
I-- I give.

00:06:54.820 --> 00:06:56.640
Thank you very much.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:59.200
Nice work. Here's a towel for you.

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:00.580
Thank you.

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:02.700
You're good enough to put the boys to shame.

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:04.750
No, I've still got a long way to go.

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:06.900
Nonsense, you're already so strong.

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:11.660
The strength I'm aiming for...

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:15.660
Is a strength enough to even change the world.

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:17.660
The world?

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.510
Whenever I talk about this,

00:07:19.510 --> 00:07:22.180
I usually just get laughed at.

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:24.600
I truly feel that way.

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:28.990
That's why I can't afford to be underestimated by anyone.

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:30.900
And yet, that Inuzuka...

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:34.610
He's always holding back and making a fool of me!

00:07:34.610 --> 00:07:35.560
Lady Persia?

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:37.150
I'll never forgive him!

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:38.430
My towel!

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:42.700
I'm sorry. I'll replace it for you later.

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:44.040
It's fine.

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:45.940
She seems really pissed.

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:51.290
I couldn't hear it too well,
but there's no doubt I'm the one she's pissed at.

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:54.450
Do I have a snowball's chance in hell?

00:07:55.590 --> 00:07:58.720
Maybe getting along with enemies really is impossible...

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:00.710
Keep walking!

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:01.760
Let go of me!

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:02.710
Those guys!

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:04.280
Our elementary schoolers!

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:04.830
What's the matter?

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:05.930
Oh, crap!

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:08.960
It's these Black Doggy brats.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:12.230
They sprayed graffiti on the White Cats' House.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:15.720
We thought we'd give them a little payback.

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:19.600
Why did you do such a thing?

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:23.490
Some Black Doggy kid made fun of us
and called us weak!

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:24.850
So we got them back!

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:26.360
Got a problem?

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:28.510
You'd better watch how you speak to us!

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:28.690
That jerk!
You'd better watch how you speak to us!

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:29.070
That jerk!

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:35.910
They were right. You are weak.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.000
What did you say?

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:39.220
Simply lashing out does not amount to a retaliation.

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:41.540
It won't help your allies when they're in trouble.

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:46.700
Tell me, what's strong about that?

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:47.710
Not a thing!

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:52.480
You meanie! I'll show you!

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:54.050
Lady Persia!

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:59.060
See? You can do it.

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:02.120
That's strength.

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:08.270
Come now, wipe up your bloody nose and go home.

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:12.250
Next time there'll be no pleasantries when we fight.

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:14.530
Big sis will take you on any time.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.000
Hold on.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:18.800
With that the Black Doggies will look down--

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:20.160
Please be quiet.

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:24.710
Are you going to let a child get you flustered?

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:28.210
If you're a White Cat, hold yourself to a higher standard.

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:34.100
That's right...

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:38.020
I was pulled towards that esteem of Persia's.

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:42.070
I've got to tell her how I feel.

00:09:42.610 --> 00:09:46.060
I have to find the courage!

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:50.290
First, I'll reach out to her in secret.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:55.450
Why are they all looking my way?

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.820
What are you here for, Inuzuka?

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:02.010
Wait, I didn't come to fight.

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:03.340
Then what do you want?

00:10:03.340 --> 00:10:05.960
Well, I was...

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:11.790
Going to co--

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:16.090
-Co-- co-- co--
-Co? What is it?

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:20.010
So close! A complaint! I'm here to complain!

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.720
Damn! I can't say it!

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:23.260
He ran away.

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:24.670
He's teasing me again!

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:25.870
Lady Persia, calm down.
He's teasing me again!

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:26.520
Lady Persia, calm down.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:29.520
I've got no spine!

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:31.290
Inuzuka?

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:33.210
Why's he coming from the gym?

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:36.540
Tosa, Persia's coming out now.

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:40.500
According to our research,
she returns to her dorm alone after practice.

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:42.030
That's when we should strike.

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:44.470
If we can just get rid of their leader, Persia,

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:46.970
crushing the White Cats will be child's play.

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:48.610
Here's a mask.

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:49.390
Thanks.

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:52.690
It'd be bad news if they saw who we are.

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:02.070
Inuzuka's half-hearted methods...

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:06.030
have never gotten us anywhere.

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:23.500
Persia.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:25.080
Who's there?

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:28.120
Persia, where are you? I can't see!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.250
I can't breathe!

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:32.260
Hey, Kohitsuji! You're supposed to
put holes in the masks, idiot!

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:34.000
Sorry, Tosa!

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:34.610
Sorry!

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:35.230
Where are you!?

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:37.940
Kohitsuji and Tosa of the Black Doggies?

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:39.080
Do you need something?

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:40.260
Oh, no, we've been made!

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:42.440
If that's so, there's only one option.

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:44.140
Let's mess her up as planned!

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:46.260
Die!

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:53.200
A two on one surprise attack?

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:55.520
You Black Doggies are trouble!

00:12:04.630 --> 00:12:07.120
It's not two on one, it's three.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:12.120
All right, got her!

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:14.380
Pepper spray?

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:19.380
You let your guard down.

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:22.100
Okay, cover the mouth.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:22.650
Got it!

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:24.640
Not yours, the girl's!

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:26.320
You lowly coward!

00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:29.430
What? All's fair in a nation's proxy war.

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:33.810
No matter the method...

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:37.570
we have to win.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:44.200
This should make it clear.

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:47.550
You've been talking so big, despite being a girl.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.450
Move!

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:58.310
Inuzuka! Why did he save Persia?

00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:01.560
That's not it. He's trying to take the glory for himself!

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:03.570
Maru, people are coming.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:06.220
Let's get out of here.

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:12.350
Ouch. I gave it too much "oomph."

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:24.300
That voice... Inuzuka?

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:27.700
Yeah it's me.

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:34.830
Does she...

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:37.330
think that I attacked her?

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:40.460
I'll just say this now, I didn't--

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:02.610
It's all over...

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:05.110
Black Doggy House
White Cats House

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:12.630
We've been waiting, Inuzuka.

00:14:12.630 --> 00:14:16.010
I'm sure you know what you've done.

00:14:16.010 --> 00:14:17.120
Let's talk outside.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:18.370
You know, you--

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:21.710
Stealing someone's prey is--

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:23.670
We'll teach you a--

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.610
We were in the middle of talking...

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:27.800
That's low...

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.150
Shut up!

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:32.690
Because of you guys I'm in the toughest pinch of my life!

00:14:32.690 --> 00:14:34.930
Another word and I'll devour you!

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:43.460
Beyond the wall...

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:49.130
If I had the courage to enter the dorm she's in
and clear up this misunderstanding...

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:52.530
No. It may be hopeless at this point.

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:54.540
If I made her make a face like that...

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:03.020
Come to the fountain in the plaza alone at once.

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:06.730
We need to talk. Bye, Persia.

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:11.550
Is this... a love letter?

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:13.150
No...

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:50.300
You've come.

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:52.800
So it was a challenge after all...

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:56.400
First, I want you to listen.

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:59.320
Earlier, were you attacking me,

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:02.000
or were you saving me?

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:04.460
If you were attacking me...

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:09.150
Then I'll settle the score with this sword.

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:10.670
What kind of sword is that?

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:13.780
It's a replica they had in the dorm, right?
It's not real, is it?

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:18.910
But if you were saving me, then why?

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:21.540
I'm your enemy, am I not?

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:24.060
"Why?" you ask?

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:26.770
I can't tell her it's because I love her.

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:29.520
My heart isn't ready for that.

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:31.730
I'll just come up with a reason and fool her.

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:34.470
If...

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:38.560
you saved me purely out of pity, then...

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:41.450
To me, that's...

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:45.190
the same as being attacked. It stings.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:51.190
I don't want anyone, especially you, Inuzuka, to pity me.

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:54.950
It may be selfish, but I think of you as a rival.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:59.390
I can't endure being seen as weak by you!

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:04.960
Persia...

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:08.980
Was she crying back there because of...?

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:12.540
I don't think that at all!

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:13.480
You're lying!

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:18.300
You always hold back when you attack,
and try to avoid fighting me!

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:22.230
That means you're making fun of me, doesn't it?

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:27.770
There you go again.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:28.700
What are you doing?

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:30.000
Teacher!

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.130
I won't lose to you!

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:32.530
Inuzuka and Persia are fighting!

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:33.950
Hey! You two again?

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:35.410
We settle this today.

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:39.340
Goodness, it's every single day with you.

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:43.040
You're the only daughter of Count Persia.

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.880
Have some more self-awareness. Tussling with a boy.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:45.400
I've heard it before.
Have some more self-awareness. Tussling with a boy.

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:46.430
I've heard it before.

00:17:46.430 --> 00:17:47.580
That the Principality of West still has a noble class.

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:50.550
A Black Doggy boy at that.
That the Principality of West still has a noble class.

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:52.520
Persia is the only daughter of the Count.

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:55.180
What would you do if you got injured and it left a scar?

00:17:55.180 --> 00:17:56.440
Your father would be sad.

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:56.890
But titles and fortunes are only inherited by men.

00:17:56.890 --> 00:18:00.820
Don't tarnish the family name...
But titles and fortunes are only inherited by men.

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:05.370
At this rate, a family might lose everything it has.

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:08.560
I see. That's why.

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:13.350
The strength I'm aiming for...

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:17.790
Is a strength enough to even change the world.

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:20.460
She wants the strength not to lose against men,

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:23.970
intelligence not to be looked down upon by other nobles,

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:26.640
influence not to be disobeyed by anyone,

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:30.790
in order to change the rules of this world.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:35.990
I hadn't even thought of how Persia felt.

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:40.680
My intention to protect her was actually hurting her.

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:50.700
Very well. I won't hold back.

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:52.020
Duel me.

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:56.280
You wanted me to go all out on you, right?

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:03.510
Thank you.

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:06.330
Show me your full power.

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:11.230
All right.

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:22.720
It's only come to this because of my half-assed resolve.

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:27.310
My indecisive attitude has harmed Persia.

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:31.860
I've got to bite down.
I'll put everything I have into this one strike,

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:33.250
and hit you...

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:36.570
Head on!

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:42.160
I love you! Go out with me!

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.770
This is me going all out!

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:56.990
For so long now--

00:19:56.990 --> 00:20:00.150
What are you talking about? Don't screw with me!

00:20:00.150 --> 00:20:02.260
Could I say something like that as a joke?

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:05.930
I love you, that's why I haven't fought you for real.

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.810
I saved you because I love you!

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:12.200
I'm not underestimating you, nor do I think you're weak.

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:14.760
How did you not notice, you airheaded girl?

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:18.610
Why would I notice that? We're enemies!

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:22.490
That's why I couldn't say anything!

00:20:22.730 --> 00:20:26.280
How many times I thought,
"If only we were from the same country"?

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:28.620
"I should just give up!"

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:32.500
But now, I've accepted my fate.

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.020
If I'm at your side,

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:40.920
I could change this world!

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:59.630
Shut up!

00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:08.120
What was that for?

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:14.270
Hey!

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:18.250
Idiot.

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:19.850
Idiot?

00:21:19.850 --> 00:21:22.810
You've been saying some crazy stuff here.

00:21:22.810 --> 00:21:27.140
There's no way you would do something
that ambitious on your own.

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:31.420
So, I'll...

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:34.140
help you out with it.

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:37.690
Does that mean...?

00:21:44.420 --> 00:21:47.050
I'll go out with you...

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:49.950
but you have to show me
that you can change the world.

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:56.060
Say it one more time.

00:21:56.680 --> 00:21:57.960
I said...

00:21:58.720 --> 00:22:00.460
I'll go out--

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:03.970
Come on, don't make me keep saying it!

00:22:04.730 --> 00:22:06.940
Wait, why are you crying?

00:22:06.940 --> 00:22:08.290
I'm not crying!

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:09.970
Then what's that liquid?

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:11.780
It's just...

00:22:11.780 --> 00:22:14.740
I didn't think you'd say okay.

00:22:14.740 --> 00:22:17.200
I thought you hated me!

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:20.610
I've never said I hated you, you know.

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:22.480
So you love me?

00:22:25.120 --> 00:22:26.540
I don't know!

00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:26.990
What?

00:22:27.410 --> 00:22:31.260
I'll only say this once.
Our relationship has to be an absolute secret.

00:22:31.260 --> 00:22:32.060
No way.

00:22:32.060 --> 00:22:33.340
If you don't like it...

00:22:33.340 --> 00:22:35.500
I got it, I got it!

00:22:36.510 --> 00:22:40.480
If I can be with you, that's fine.

00:22:43.350 --> 00:22:45.860
And so, the two of us...

00:22:47.060 --> 00:22:48.520
I'll be in your care.

00:22:48.520 --> 00:22:51.710
Likewise.

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:54.870
...became secret lovers.

00:23:09.420 --> 00:23:12.130
Oh, hey, Persia.

00:23:12.130 --> 00:23:13.550
What a coincidence.

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:17.640
Now that we've met,
we might as well walk to school together.

00:23:17.640 --> 00:23:19.540
We are lovers, after all.

00:23:21.600 --> 00:23:23.800
Please don't speak to me.

00:23:27.520 --> 00:23:30.800
What kind of response is that?
Could last night have been a dream?

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:31.890
Morning, Inuzuka!

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:32.800
Lady Persia!

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:38.310
Persia is once again shining like the sun's rays,
guiding us--

00:23:38.310 --> 00:23:39.780
--with her devotion and...

00:23:39.780 --> 00:23:42.560
That's right, because people are around.

00:23:43.200 --> 00:23:45.320
Isn't it?

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:47.580
Tell me that's why!

00:23:47.580 --> 00:23:50.460
Persia!

00:23:52.710 --> 00:23:56.200
Hey, it's me, Romio Inuzuka. Guys, listen.

00:23:56.200 --> 00:23:59.090
I confessed to Persia, who I've loved forever!

00:23:59.090 --> 00:24:01.540
But it's a forbidden love.

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:01.620
Next time, Rosario and Juliet.

00:24:01.620 --> 00:24:04.020
Rosario and Juliet
Next time, Rosario and Juliet.

00:24:04.020 --> 00:24:07.000
No matter happens, I'll protect Persia!
Rosario and Juliet

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:07.010
No matter happens, I'll protect Persia!
